# Email sent to a Vireo user when an administrator starts a password reset
# for that user's account.
#
# Parameters: {RESET_URL} is expanded to a special URL
#
Subject: Vireo Password Reset
A password reset was started for your Vireo account. To choose a new
password, please click the link below:

  {RESET_URL}

This link works once and stops working after a limited time. If it no
longer works, ask your Vireo administrator to send a new one.

If you were not expecting this message, you do not need to do anything.
Your password has not been changed.

If you need assistance with your account, please email
etd-support@jhu.edu.

The Hopkins ETD Team
